@page "/services"

<PageTitle>Services — ProManager Online</PageTitle>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-light/60 to-white">
    <div class="container-site py-16 text-center">
        <span class="badge mb-4">Services</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
            Business software, ready to use or built to fit
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-600">
            We help small companies in two ways: subscribe to our all-in-one business
            management software, or hire us to build custom software around the way you work.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- The two core offerings -->
<section class="container-site py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="card flex flex-col">
            <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
                    <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="badge mt-4 self-start">Business management software</span>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">An all-in-one system to run your business</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-slate-600">
                Our business management platform — an ERP for small companies — brings your
                customers, quotes, invoicing, inventory and accounting together in one place, with
                automation for the routine work. You subscribe by the month or year, and we build,
                host and maintain it for you.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a class="btn-primary" href="/products">Explore the software</a>
                <a class="btn-secondary" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card flex flex-col">
            <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6" /><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="badge mt-4 self-start">Custom development</span>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Custom software, built to fit</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-slate-600">
                When off-the-shelf software won't do, we design and build it for you — web and
                business apps, integrations and tailored features. Projects run on a clear,
                milestone-based plan, and you're invoiced for development work as each milestone
                is delivered.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Start a project</a>
                <a class="btn-secondary" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- What the business software covers -->
<section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="container-site py-12">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <span class="badge mb-3">Business management software</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
                Everything a small business juggles, in one place
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
                Stop stitching together spreadsheets and a dozen separate apps. Our platform keeps
                the day-to-day running of your business in a single, tidy system.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                        <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" /><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Customers &amp; CRM</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Keep every contact, conversation and deal in one place.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" /><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                        <line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13" /><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Quotes &amp; invoicing</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Send professional quotes and invoices, and track what's been paid.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z" />
                        <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96" /><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Inventory</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Track stock levels, suppliers and reorders — adjusted automatically as you sell.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10" /><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4" /><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Accounting &amp; reporting</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">See the numbers that matter, without the spreadsheet gymnastics.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Workflow automation</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Let the routine, repetitive work run itself in the background.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Hosted &amp; maintained</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">We host it, keep it updated and back it up. You just sign in.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- How custom projects work, and how billing works (clarity for payment review) -->
<section class="container-site py-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="badge mb-3">How custom projects work</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            A clear scope, delivered in milestones
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
            Every project starts with an agreed scope. We break the work into milestones, and
            you're invoiced for development work as each milestone is completed and delivered.
        </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <li class="card">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Scope &amp; quote</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">We agree on what we're building and send a written quote that lays out the milestones and their cost.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">2</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Build a milestone</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">We develop the agreed piece of work and keep you updated on progress as we go.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">3</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Deliver &amp; invoice</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">When a milestone is delivered, we invoice you for that completed development work.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">4</span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Continue or wrap up</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">We move to the next milestone, and finish when the agreed scope is complete.</p>
        </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="card mt-8 border-brand/20 bg-brand-light/30">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Plain and simple: you pay us for our own software and services</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
            A subscription is a recurring fee for access to software we build, host and maintain.
            A milestone invoice is payment for development work we have already delivered. We do
            not offer financing or installment credit, we do not hold money in escrow, and we do
            not process or move money on behalf of any third party. Every charge is a direct,
            professional arrangement between you and ProManager Online.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Closing call to action -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-brand-light/40">
    <div class="container-site py-16 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Not sure which one fits?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-600">
            Tell us what you're trying to do. We'll point you to the right subscription plan, or
            scope a custom project — no obligation.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
            <a class="btn-secondary" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
